    "body": "## SHERIFF R01 — RED / GREEN DURABLE CHECKPOINT\n\n**RESULT**\n- `THREE_CHAT_SHERIFF_HARD_CONTROL_R01 = CI_PASS_CANDIDATE`.\n- PR #252 remains **DRAFT / OPEN / NOT MERGED**.\n- Exact GREEN HEAD: `a5a9f15e959d58f1998b110396d5ad6f2eb27c9e`.\n- Base: `duncan/zorr-studio-r01 @ f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665`.\n- This is CI/static contract enforcement only. It is **not** `PRODUCTION_PASS` and does not promote any studio production gate.\n\n**DELTA**\n- Added `studio/ZORR_SHERIFF_THREE_CHAT_LAW_R01.md` as the shared invariant for CHAT A/B/C.\n- Added stdlib fail-closed `scripts/validate_three_chat_sheriff.py`.\n- Bound `studio/ZORR_MASTER_CHAT_BOOTSTRAP_R01.md` and `studio/ZORR_THREE_CHAT_ORCHESTRATION_R01.md` to fresh-read the shared law.\n- Reused existing `.github/workflows/hq-validate.yml`; no second SHERIFF workflow/control plane was created.\n- Added regression/negative tests for stale hardcoded CURRENT HEAD and CHAT C/#251 role-tracker drift.\n\n**TDD RED EVIDENCE**\n- RED HEAD: `24d212f4dd18674fbe3e10c80629ea02d0851da2`.\n- `hq-validate #858 / run 33446306010 = FAILURE`.\n- `hq-control-tower-integrity = SUCCESS`.\n- `hq-scope-guard = SUCCESS`.\n- `hq-schema = FAILURE` at full unittest step after existing `scripts/hq_validate.py` had succeeded.\n- `scripts/validate_three_chat_sheriff.py` was intentionally absent on RED HEAD; fresh read returned 404. Therefore the new test suite demonstrated the missing enforcement before implementation.\n\n**GREEN EVIDENCE**\n- GREEN HEAD: `a5a9f15e959d58f1998b110396d5ad6f2eb27c9e`.\n- `hq-validate #863 / run 33446473300 = SUCCESS` on that exact HEAD.\n- 3/3 jobs SUCCESS: `hq-schema`, `hq-scope-guard`, `hq-control-tower-integrity`.\n- Inside `hq-schema`: existing HQ validator SUCCESS -> three-chat SHERIFF validator SUCCESS -> full unittest suite SUCCESS.\n\n**FRESH READBACK**\n- shared law blob: `fff8363a741caa0af84c7714f291a22e04a12305`.\n- validator blob: `367f8f4d0afb39c9c5e19e1a0453c27811a3a43d`.\n- master bootstrap blob: `79f4a0ef6e0905e0d371486d43b149ab92c564eb`.\n- orchestration blob: `8b350b82de07de12bade823b94d96c8d613ef008`.\n- hq-validate workflow blob: `85bc6c48ad7f15871828a8e8c093fc06ec91c5e5`.\n- Fresh base read confirms `duncan/zorr-studio-r01` remains at `f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665`.\n\n**SHERIFF PROCESS NOTE / SELF-CAUGHT**\n- Before the isolated branch/TDD cycle, one premature bootstrap write was made on the studio branch (`d3da4b9b3c02a76b60d05714e82f7f6c6cd9c313`).\n- It was immediately identified as a process violation and content-reverted by `f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665` before creating the isolated implementation branch.\n- No false PASS is claimed for that step; the real candidate proof begins with the RED HEAD above.\n\n**OPEN / NEXT LEGAL GATE**\n- Independent review/QC of exact HEAD `a5a9f15e...`.\n- Merge into `duncan/zorr-studio-r01` only under an explicit legal integration decision.\n- Until merge, the shared law is `ACTIVE CANDIDATE / CI ENFORCED ON PR #252`, not authoritative production state.",
